---
// NewsletterBox — static placeholder; wire up to EmailOctopus/ConvertKit on deployment
---

<div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 border border-brand-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50 to-slate-50">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
    <!-- Icon -->
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-100 border border-brand-200 
                flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0">
      📬
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">
        获取每周评测更新
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        新评测、节点速度变化、流媒体解锁状态，每周五发送，不做任何广告。
      </p>

      <!-- Form (static placeholder) -->
      <form class="flex gap-2" onsubmit="return false;" aria-label="订阅表单">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          class="flex-1 min-w-0 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-300
                 text-sm text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none 
                 focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500/40
                 transition-colors"
          aria-label="邮箱地址"
          autocomplete="email"
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="btn-primary text-sm px-4 py-2.5 flex-shrink-0"
        >
          订阅
        </button>
      </form>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">无垃圾邮件，随时退订。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
